            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-343] Failed to register hedwig JMX beans in test cases</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-343</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;failed to register jmx beans for hedwig running test cases.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;the exception is as below:&lt;/p&gt;

